# Reporting Cycle Calculation

This scope calculates the next required reporting date based on a previous report date and a specified frequency.

```catala
declaration scope ReportingCycle:
  input last_report_date content date
  input reporting_frequency content duration
  output next_report_date content date
```

## Calculate Next Reporting Date

The next report date is determined by adding the reporting frequency to the last report date.

```catala
scope ReportingCycle:
  date round down
  definition next_report_date equals
    last_report_date + reporting_frequency
```